---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About | Tom Batting"
	description="Tom Batting is a Forbes 30 Under 30 entrepreneur, founder of Obby and Baluu, and advisor to founders and leadership teams."
>
	<main>
		<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-20 pb-24 sm:pt-28">
			<h1 class="font-sans text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-vaqa-ink sm:text-5xl">
				About Tom
			</h1>
			<div class="mt-8 space-y-6 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-vaqa-ink/80">
				<p>
					Tom Batting is a Forbes 30 Under 30 entrepreneur and the founder of Obby and Baluu,
					two high-growth platforms that were successfully scaled and acquired.
				</p>
				<p>
					Tom advises founders and leadership teams on board strategy, growth, go-to-market,
					AI implementation, operational efficiency, and finance and fundraising. His focus
					is on clarity and outcomes, drawing on first-hand experience of building, scaling,
					and exiting his own ventures.
				</p>
				<p>
					He combines big-picture thinking with practical, operator-level insight — and isn't
					afraid to get into the detail when it matters.
				</p>
				<p>
					Outside of work, he's a proud father of four and a big fan of LEGO, snowsports,
					padel tennis, and discovering great food.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
